# Search scope — envybot

CLI and radio session code live here. The fleet **book** is a private
directory with `nodes.yaml` (`--book` / `ENVYBOT_HOME`). Do not hardcode a
book repo. Ops strategy is `ops/initiatives/envybot-radio-daemon.md`.

| Need | `path` / `target_directory` |
|------|-----------------------------|
| CLI, commands, book resolver | `envybot/` |
| nodes.yaml / last-seen | the operator book dir, not this repo |
| Enterprise / sitrep pointers | `ops/` |

Do not copy secrets from the book into this repo.
